  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 108,
    "summary": "David praises and exalts God—Judah is the Lord’s lawgiver.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O God, my heart is fixed; I will sing and give praise, even with my glory.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Ps. 57:7 (7–11); 2 Ne. 22:5; Alma 26:8; D&C 136:28."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Awake, psaltery and harp: I myself will awake early.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 34
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "I will praise thee, O Lord, among the people: and I will sing praises unto thee among the nations.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "For thy mercy is great above the heavens: and thy truth reacheth unto the clouds.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 16
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 64
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Be thou exalted, O God, above the heavens: and thy glory above all the earth;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "That thy beloved may be delivered: save with thy right hand, and answer me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "IE beloved people."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "Ps. 60:5 (5–12)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "God hath spoken in his holiness; I will rejoice, I will divide Shechem, and mete out the valley of Succoth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "OR in His sanctuary."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Gilead is mine; Manasseh is mine; Ephraim also is the strength of mine head; Judah is my lawgiver;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 9
          },
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 27
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 49
          },
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Moab is my washpot; over Edom will I cast out my shoe; over Philistia will I triumph.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Who will bring me into the strong city? who will lead me into Edom?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Wilt not thou, O God, who hast cast us off? and wilt not thou, O God, go forth with our hosts?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4
          },
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 14
          },
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Give us help from trouble: for vain is the help of man.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Through God we shall do valiantly: for he it is that shall tread down our enemies.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 108:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 108,
        "verse": 13
      }
    ]
  },
